msgid "Server-level restrictions that reduce each directory’s attack surface. These rules govern HTTP requests only — they never block plugin or theme installs and updates, which happen entirely in PHP. On OpenLiteSpeed these .htaccess rules are honored only when \"Allow Override\" is enabled for the vhost (LiteSpeed WebAdmin → Rewrite → Auto Load from .htaccess); when override is off they have no effect but cause no harm."
