#: src/components/HardeningSettings.jsx:868
msgid "This web server is not applying your .htaccess rules."
msgstr ""

#: src/components/HardeningSettings.jsx:874
msgid "The hardening files are present and intact, but every deny rule below is inert, so direct requests to plugins/*.php, readme.html, license.txt and xmlrpc.php still get through. The plugin now uses OpenLiteSpeed-compatible RewriteRule directives; on LiteSpeed enable \"Auto Load from .htaccess\" (WebAdmin → Virtual Host → Rewrite), reload the web server, and run \"Verify enforcement\" again. Moving the rules into the vhost/context config is still an option if .htaccess loading must stay off."
